meta {
  name: Health Check
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Health Check

  Use this request to confirm the Billxpress backend server is running.

  ## Expected Success Response

  Status: `200 OK`

  Body:

  ```txt
  BillXpress API running...
  ```

  ## Common Issues

  If this fails, check that the backend is running on the same port as `baseUrl`.
}
